# callbacks command prefixes (called with the arguments appended). A mutable reference parameter
# takes a variable name. C++ exceptions raise Tcl errors with -errorcode {DATAMUNGE kind cpp_type
# message} (kind: invalid_argument, out_of_range, runtime_error, ...); binding errors use
# {DATAMUNGE binding message}.
