    # Tape -- SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::autodiff::Tape -- a reverse-mode ("backpropagation") computation tape. Create leaf Vars against a Tape, build an expression out of named Var operations, then call backward() on the output Var to get the derivative of that output with respect to every node on the tape (index a leaf's own index() into the result to read its gradient).
